      '✓ Duty Allocation Complete!\n\n' +
      'New Duties Allocated: ' + allocation.duties.length + '\n' +
      'Faculty Assigned: ' + allocation.summary.length + '\n' +
      'Total Cumulative Duties: ' + allocation.totalDuties + '\n\n' +
      'Saved to Drive: "Duty Allocation Sheet"\n' +
      '• Tab: ' + formatDate(controlData.examDate) + '_' + controlData.session + '\n' +
